# 每 5 分钟检查一次工单 SLA 超时；上一次未结束时不会重复启动；关机期间错过的不补做（下次触发会一并处理）
# Check ticket SLA every 5 minutes; a run never overlaps the previous one; missed runs are not replayed (the next run covers them)
[Unit]
Description=Yonlink-CRM ticket SLA escalation every 5 minutes

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*:0/5
AccuracySec=30s
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
